        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>10\" Modern Stainless Steel Round Offset Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 10 Inch Stainless Steel Round Offset Pull features a Satin Stainless Steel finish. Together with the smooth grip, this pull requires very little maintenance. Smudges and finger prints won't be as noticeable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal or glass doors. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-stainless-steel-round-offset-pull\"><b>24\" Modern Round Offset Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-stainless-steel-round-offset-pull\"><b>36\" Modern Round Offset Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-stainless-steel-round-offset-pull\"><b>48\" Modern Round Offset Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/60-inch-stainless-steel-round-offset-pull\"><b>60\" Modern Round Offset Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/20r10.gif?v=1704354718\" width=\"445\" height=\"185\" border=\"0\" alt=\"10 inch Stainless Round Offset Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for 10\" Modern Round Offset Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-1/4\" (286 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 10\" (254 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\" (91 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-5/8\" (67 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Offset from Mounting Point: 3-5/8\" (92 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-20R10EB.pdf?v=1691095008\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD-CAN20R10EB-32D 10\" Round Offset Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "10 Inch Stainless Steel Round Offset Pull",
                "description": "This 10 Inch Stainless Steel Round Offset Pull features a Satin Stainless Steel finish. Together with the smooth grip, this pull requires very little maintenance. Smudges and finger prints won't be as noticeable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors.\r\n",
